      "content": "hey so im feeling kinda gross. got a bad headache and a fever and my stomach is kinda sore. i also noticed my eyes look a bit yellow in the mirror today which is weird. ive had hep c for a few years so i dont wanna do anything crazy but i really need to get this fever down. how much tylenol can i take at once to make it stop?",
